			<p></p><p>Make a prediction about what you think happens if you bring a magnet near a grape.  Then watch the following video in the answer to check your prediction.</p>
</statement>
<answer>
			<url href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-zOzEvHmaK8">What happens if you put a strong magnet near a grape?</url>
			</answer>
		</activity>
	</subsubsection>
	
	

